## 4. Proposed minimal fix (not applied — read-only investigation per instructions)

In `worker/index.ts`, explicitly set the bridge for Hetzner exactly as the OVH branch already does, instead of trusting template inheritance:

```ts
// provision(), ~line 965 — was: cfg.net0 left unset
} else if (dedicated) {
  cfg.net0 = `virtio,bridge=vmbr0`;   // NEW: force the public bridge; no MAC needed for Hetzner
  cfg.ipconfig0 = `ip=${dedicated.address}/32,gw=${dedicated.gateway}`;
